  "text": "The easiest way to make agency clients feel valued and extend retainer lifespans is automated gifting. Founders intend to celebrate client wins, but hectic sprints push relationship building to the back burner. When clients feel like an invoice number, renewals become transactional and churn spikes. Connect HubSpot to Sendoso using Zapier to dispatch personalized gifts on client anniversaries and revenue wins. You deepen executive loyalty and protect retainer revenue.",
